#: ../../source/reference/pybroker.context.rst:2
#: ebbbad74c39a4a97a99d80fa44c1e4dd
msgid "pybroker.context module"
msgstr "pybroker.context 模块"

#: 762b597046764648bee3dc640a6e4136 of pybroker.context:1
msgid ""
"Contains context related classes. A context provides data during the "
"execution of a :class:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy`."
msgstr "包含与上下文相关的类。上下文在 :class:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy` 的执行过程中提供数据。"

#: d1b7e0167f6143d4b4a431d4bef10db8 of pybroker.context.ExecContext:1
msgid ""
"Contains context data during the execution of a "
":class:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy`. Includes data about the current bar,"
" portfolio positions, and other relevant context. This class is also used"
" to set buy and sell signals for placing orders."
msgstr ""
"包含 :class:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy` 执行过程中的上下文数据。包括当前 K "
"线、投资组合头寸以及其他相关上下文的数据。该类也用于设置买入和卖出信号以下单。"

#: 614ebe9a884a430fa7c16bab53ef1640 of pybroker.context.ExecContext:6
msgid ""
"The data contained in this class is for the latest bar that has already "
"completed. Placing an order will be executed on a future bar specified by"
" :attr:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.buy_delay` and "
":attr:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.sell_delay`."
msgstr ""
"该类中包含的数据是已完成的最新一根 K 线的数据。下单会在由 "
":attr:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.buy_delay` 和 "
":attr:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.sell_delay` 指定的未来某根 K 线上执行。"

#: 45df71b82d884c808e03588194e3928c 6894f30e5ec44459aa1c1897b7e7c920 of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext:13 pybroker.context.RotationContext:33
msgid ":class:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig`."
msgstr ":class:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig`。"

#: 45f804d134f44919853e58ff63309bf9 of pybroker.context.ExecContext:17
msgid "Current ticker symbol of the execution."
msgstr "该执行函数当前的股票代码。"

#: 4649edc0a96c490e9b7a5c75442d2aa5 eae22e026fbe46d48543b8ab5d5d1895 of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext:21 pybroker.context.ExecResult:18
msgid "Fill price to use for a buy (long) order of ``symbol``."
msgstr "``symbol`` 买入（做多）订单使用的成交价格。"

#: 20902760062849fda015a461c191f560 ef8991fb4dc7462f9a40c13c76547591 of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext:26 pybroker.context.ExecResult:66
msgid "Number of shares to buy of ``symbol``."
msgstr "``symbol`` 要买入的股数。"

#: 6ed0b5261b5c45ab859ac2af647fb7ec of pybroker.context.ExecContext:30
msgid "Limit price to use for a buy (long) order of ``symbol``."
msgstr "``symbol`` 买入（做多）订单使用的限价。"

#: 7103e3d55d8c42d296ed51b35f3fc041 d6619e0994d94a42ad64286cba3fbd20 of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext:35 pybroker.context.ExecResult:78
msgid ""
"Number of bars to retry an unfilled buy limit order after the first "
"attempt. ``None`` for a single attempt, ``-1`` for indefinite "
"persistence, or a positive integer for a limited number of retry bars."
msgstr ""
"未成交的买入限价单在首次尝试后重试的 K 线数量。 ``None`` 表示仅尝试一次， ``-1`` 表示无限期保留，正整数表示有限的重试 K "
"线数量。"

#: 2978c02c95a24821880780b2e4f5ec50 36329a54547944e38779bff3f40ca34b of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext:42 pybroker.context.ExecResult:24
msgid "Fill price to use for a sell (short) order of ``symbol``."
msgstr "``symbol`` 卖出（做空）订单使用的成交价格。"

#: 0f4256ce5f1f452ea0c1e706ca945729 77574164884b440dbf2668bfe973b6e3 of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext:47 pybroker.context.ExecResult:87
msgid "Number of shares to sell of ``symbol``."
msgstr "``symbol`` 要卖出的股数。"

#: 11e4f21b306643d6a91341e208e38ba3 of pybroker.context.ExecContext:51
msgid "Limit price to use for a sell (short) order of ``symbol``."
msgstr "``symbol`` 卖出（做空）订单使用的限价。"

#: a546f244a3b3441bb3483b816c2a6451 efff1b0aa5064a96aa99061f7e065798 of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext:56 pybroker.context.ExecResult:100
msgid ""
"Number of bars to retry an unfilled sell limit order after the first "
"attempt. ``None`` for a single attempt, ``-1`` for indefinite "
"persistence, or a positive integer for a limited number of retry bars."
msgstr ""
"未成交的卖出限价单在首次尝试后重试的 K 线数量。 ``None`` 表示仅尝试一次， ``-1`` 表示无限期保留，正整数表示有限的重试 K "
"线数量。"

#: 17ff492888d645e2be71b2c881047e9e 1e9efccdd0354171933b605206c94b22 of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext:63 pybroker.context.ExecResult:59
msgid ""
"Number of bars to hold a long or short position for, after which the "
"position is automatically liquidated."
msgstr "持有多头或空头仓位的 K 线数量，超过后该仓位会自动平仓。"

#: 4fa161a167204c50a27290b6f9cf2860 92690ee7bbf44f66bd11f0b101cba4a5 of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext:68 pybroker.context.ExecResult:31
msgid ""
"Score used to rank ``symbol`` when ranking buy and cover signals. Orders "
"are placed for symbols with the highest ``long_score`` values, where the "
"number of long positions held at any time in the "
":class:`pybroker.portfolio.Portfolio` is specified by "
":meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_long_positions`. When rotation "
"is enabled with :meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation`, "
"``long_score`` drives long rotation and orders set during an "
":class:`pybroker.strategy.Execution` are ignored."
msgstr ""
"在对买入和回补信号进行排序时用于给 ``symbol`` 打分。订单会为 ``long_score`` "
"值最高的品种下达，:class:`pybroker.portfolio.Portfolio` 中任一时刻持有的多头仓位数量由 "
":meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_long_positions` 指定。当通过 "
":meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation` 启用了轮动时， ``long_score``"
" 会驱动多头轮动，而 :class:`pybroker.strategy.Execution` 中设置的订单会被忽略。"

#: 85dcbfae19234863916f8071626b9657 997ebeab16064894ae80cc336b729252 of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext:80 pybroker.context.ExecResult:45
msgid ""
"Score used to rank ``symbol`` when ranking sell signals. Orders are "
"placed for symbols with the highest ``short_score`` values, where the "
"number of short positions held at any time in the "
":class:`pybroker.portfolio.Portfolio` is specified by "
":meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_short_positions`. When rotation"
" is enabled with :meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation`, "
"``short_score`` drives short rotation and orders set during an "
":class:`pybroker.strategy.Execution` are ignored."
msgstr ""
"在对卖出信号进行排序时用于给 ``symbol`` 打分。订单会为 ``short_score`` "
"值最高的品种下达，:class:`pybroker.portfolio.Portfolio` 中任一时刻持有的空头仓位数量由 "
":meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_short_positions` 指定。当通过 "
":meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation` 启用了轮动时， "
"``short_score`` 会驱动空头轮动，而 :class:`pybroker.strategy.Execution` "
"中设置的订单会被忽略。"

#: 9448405d047d4d0b927896b8b3ce4cbc of pybroker.context.ExecContext:92
msgid ""
"``dict`` used to store custom data that persists for each bar during the "
":class:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy`\\ 's execution."
msgstr ""
"用于存储自定义数据的 ``dict``，在 :class:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy`\\ 的执行过程中按每根 K "
"线持久化。"

#: 2a280c16cbe241b3be9ae2923139ff45 of pybroker.context.ExecContext:97
msgid ""
"Sets stop loss on a new :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Entry`, where value is"
" measured in points from entry price."
msgstr "在新的 :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Entry` 上设置止损，其值以距入场价格的点数衡量。"

#: 0d65b743bf364320be8936ee31c2e812 of pybroker.context.ExecContext:102
msgid ""
"Sets stop loss on a new :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Entry`, where value is"
" measured in percentage from entry price."
msgstr "在新的 :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Entry` 上设置止损，其值以距入场价格的百分比衡量。"

#: bc42cb6896b54f68b8596269330e3494 of pybroker.context.ExecContext:108
msgid "Limit price to use for the stop loss."
msgstr "该止损使用的限价。"

#: d8b698ed482147909cddc538b487c2b6 of pybroker.context.ExecContext:112
msgid ""
"Exit :class:`pybroker.common.PriceType` to use for the stop loss exit. If"
" set, the stop is checked against the ``exit_price`` and exits at the "
"``exit_price`` when triggered."
msgstr ""
"止损离场时使用的离场 :class:`pybroker.common.PriceType`。如果设置了该值，止损会依据 "
"``exit_price`` 进行判定，并在触发时以 ``exit_price`` 离场。"

#: 8b4283a694644bedaa88c63f3ec50c10 of pybroker.context.ExecContext:118
msgid ""
"Sets profit stop on a new :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Entry`, where value "
"is measured in points from entry price."
msgstr "在新的 :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Entry` 上设置止盈，其值以距入场价格的点数衡量。"

#: e192c0859a9b4d569c31f451b03e3b39 of pybroker.context.ExecContext:124
msgid ""
"Sets profit stop on a new :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Entry`, where value "
"is measured in percentage from entry price."
msgstr "在新的 :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Entry` 上设置止盈，其值以距入场价格的百分比衡量。"

#: 6c4fbe0c2af74abeaf215c5a9abe9cda of pybroker.context.ExecContext:130
msgid "Limit price to use for the profit stop."
msgstr "该止盈使用的限价。"

#: 28c5e45702844e6c8da2f7a4146b6d73 of pybroker.context.ExecContext:134
msgid ""
"Exit :class:`pybroker.common.PriceType` to use for the profit stop exit. "
"If set, the stop is checked against the ``exit_price`` and exits at the "
"``exit_price`` when triggered."
msgstr ""
"止盈离场时使用的离场 :class:`pybroker.common.PriceType`。如果设置了该值，止盈会依据 "
"``exit_price`` 进行判定，并在触发时以 ``exit_price`` 离场。"

#: 9800df73b6e84912a946f120e2c3d123 of pybroker.context.ExecContext:140
msgid ""
"Sets a trailing stop loss on a new :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Entry`, "
"where value is measured in points from entry price."
msgstr "在新的 :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Entry` 上设置移动止损，其值以距入场价格的点数衡量。"

#: ee9fb3d3fe2b446ea5a3d8a63de6ce3b of pybroker.context.ExecContext:146
msgid ""
"Sets a trailing stop loss on a new :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Entry`, "
"where value is measured in percentage from entry price."
msgstr "在新的 :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Entry` 上设置移动止损，其值以距入场价格的百分比衡量。"

#: 45b215c2635147bd8c97107a9c7f2bf3 of pybroker.context.ExecContext:152
msgid "Limit price to use for the trailing stop loss."
msgstr "该移动止损使用的限价。"

#: 3157403610dd44b1bfdc9db65c8b7c3f of pybroker.context.ExecContext:156
msgid ""
"Exit :class:`pybroker.common.PriceType` to use for the trailing stop "
"exit. If set, the stop is checked against the ``exit_price`` and exits at"
" the ``exit_price`` when triggered."
msgstr ""
"移动止损离场时使用的离场 :class:`pybroker.common.PriceType`。如果设置了该值，止损会依据 "
"``exit_price`` 进行判定，并在触发时以 ``exit_price`` 离场。"

#: f51f37f3770e4b3da131b880621cf6c6 of pybroker.context.ExecContext.bars:1
msgid "Number of bars of data that have completed."
msgstr "已完成的数据 K 线数量。"

#: 9a96c17282d84ed58569efb32aa4e0d2 of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext.buying_power:1
msgid ""
"Available buying power for long and short orders given "
":attr:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.leverage`."
msgstr "在给定 :attr:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.leverage` 的情况下，可用于多头和空头订单的购买力。"

#: 555d3fca41cb472f874bf5971fbcd0d3 of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext.buying_power:4
msgid ""
"This is what the :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Portfolio` clamps orders "
"against at fill time. :meth:`.calc_target_shares` sizes off deployable "
"capital (equity multiplied by leverage) instead, so the two can differ "
"once positions are open."
msgstr ""
"这正是 :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Portfolio` 在成交时用来限定订单的依据。而 "
":meth:`.calc_target_shares` 则是按可部署资本（权益乘以杠杆）来确定规模的，因此一旦有仓位开仓，两者可能会出现差异。"

#: 761e219dedf0461fb05d471f69e20dc4 of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext.calc_target_shares:1
msgid ""
"Calculates the number of shares given a ``target_size`` allocation and "
"share ``price``."
msgstr "根据 ``target_size`` 分配比例和股票 ``price``，计算股数。"

#: ../../source/reference/pybroker.context.rst 0e02c6d74cd64fbe8ffeee41a3e7100c
