msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: 1a57581119224edbb1ada126ae3656ae of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext.calc_target_shares:4
msgid ""
"Proportion of deployable capital used to calculate the number of shares, "
"where the max ``target_size`` is ``1``. For example, a ``target_size`` of"
" ``0.1`` would represent 10% of deployable capital."
msgstr ""
"用于计算股数的可部署资本比例，其中 ``target_size`` 的最大值为 ``1``。例如， ``target_size`` 为 "
"``0.1`` 表示可部署资本的 10%。"

#: cddc850df69d462d9cc2976967f099b8 of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext.calc_target_shares:8
msgid ""
"Share price used to calculate the number of shares. If ``None``, the "
"share price of the ``ExecContext``\\ 's :attr:`.symbol` is used."
msgstr "用于计算股数的股价。如果为 ``None``，则使用 ``ExecContext``\\ 的 :attr:`.symbol` 的股价。"

#: 8e400c278a174bd5af2cd24249aab4ca of
#: pybroker.context.ExecContext.calc_target_shares:11
msgid ""
"Capital used to calculate the number of shares. If ``None``, deployable "
"capital is used, defined as portfolio equity multiplied by "
":attr:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.leverage`. The resulting order is "
"still capped by :attr:`.buying_power` when it is placed."
msgstr ""
"用于计算股数的资本。如果为 ``None``，则使用可部署资本，定义为投资组合权益乘以 "
":attr:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.leverage`。生成的订单在下达时仍会受到 "
":attr:`.buying_power` 的限制。"

#: ../../source/reference/pybroker.context.rst 3ba774fda80d47ff85bc4e86a915ab52
#: 416bd8303143467a85a8da0b827a61bf 59490f55391d48e8a5247a7931ad44fa
