#: 93ead55f3d7d4de4bbd6c6c7da2cac11 of pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval:3
msgid ""
"``interval`` must match a value this execution declared with "
"``intervals`` in :meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution`, or an "
"interval bound to one of the execution's models or indicators with "
":meth:`pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals` / "
":meth:`pybroker.indicator.Indicator.intervals`. Intervals are scoped per "
"execution: reading an interval that another execution declared raises "
"``ValueError``, the same way :meth:`.hyperparam` is gated by the "
"execution's ``hyperparams``. The same "
":class:`~pybroker.interval.TimeframeInterval` forms are supported:"
msgstr ""
"``interval`` 必须与该执行函数在 :meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution` "
"中通过 ``intervals`` 声明的值匹配，或者与通过 "
":meth:`pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals` / "
":meth:`pybroker.indicator.Indicator.intervals` "
"绑定到其某个模型或指标的区间匹配。区间的作用域限定在各自的执行函数内：读取另一个执行函数声明的区间会引发 ``ValueError``，这与 "
":meth:`.hyperparam` 受该执行函数的 ``hyperparams`` 限定的方式相同。支持相同的 "
":class:`~pybroker.interval.TimeframeInterval` 形式："

#: 81f6fbb7efb74c4a87812a72bd084317 of pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval:14
msgid ""
"**Every-n-bars** (``int``): e.g. ``ctx.interval(5)`` for bars formed from"
" every 5 base bars."
msgstr "**每 n 根 K 线** （``int``）：例如 ``ctx.interval(5)`` 表示由每 5 根基础 K 线形成的 K 线。"

#: 04e02602f1644e94b6d5936d4f6c1145 of pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval:17
msgid ""
"**Duration** (``str``): e.g. ``ctx.interval(\"5m\")`` for fixed-duration "
"bins (digits plus unit letter)."
msgstr "**时长** （``str``）：例如 ``ctx.interval(\"5m\")`` 表示固定时长的分箱（数字加单位字母）。"

#: d987ce1e8109468bac8cf0e28b7923bf of pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval:20
msgid ""
"**Calendar** (``str``): e.g. ``ctx.interval(\"weekly\")`` for calendar "
"weekly bars. Weeks start on Monday, months on the first of the month, "
"quarters in January, April, July, and October, and years on January 1."
msgstr ""
"**日历** （``str``）：例如 ``ctx.interval(\"weekly\")`` 表示日历周线 K 线。周从周一开始，月从每月 1"
" 日开始，季度从 1、4、7、10 月开始，年从 1 月 1 日开始。"

